   "key": "func JSONOrderingTests.testOpenAICompatibleRequestBodyIsEncodedWithSortedKeys()",
   "hash": "0c20b2e63320af39",
   "does": "Builds a DeepSeek StreamCall and its request through OpenAICompatibleStreamer.requestFor, finds the first '\"messages\":', '\"model\":', '\"stream\":' and '\"stream_options\":' in the body text (decoded as UTF-8; the test fails if it is not), and asserts messages precedes model and stream precedes stream_options, the reverse of the private body's declaration order (model, messages, stream, stream_options), i.e. the body was encoded with .sortedKeys; then asserts the request carries 'Bearer test-key' authorization and the SSE Accept header.",
